      "rationale": "Latest usage declared consideration, not INFNet execution or local causal confirmation. This turn read the authorized original paper pages 1-4, benchmark section 2.3 and pinned implementation lines 204-313. r0067 norm-restored and rescaled paths both lost click AUC; the unresolved local task-family confound motivates this bounded factorial instead of wholesale architecture replacement.",
